title: Key Flow: Realtime Snapshot

provider: "Market Data Provider"
watchlist: "Watchlist File"
runtime: "Backend Runtime"
state: "In-Memory Market State"
publisher: "Snapshot Publisher"
frontend: "Frontend Dashboard"
user: "Dashboard User"

watchlist -> runtime: scopes symbols
provider -> runtime: sends updates
runtime -> state: validates/applies
state -> publisher: builds snapshot
publisher -> frontend: pushes full snapshot
frontend -> user: renders dashboard
